      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "To set the ball with two \nhands, you must hit the ball\nwith both hands
    at the \nsame time.\n\nThe aim is determined as \nthe middle of how your \npalms
    are oriented, as \ndisplayed in the image.\n\nAs a pointer for direction, try
    to aim by orienting the diamond between your thumbs and index fingers towards
    where you want to hit.\nHand speed on impact again determines set strength."
