  m_text: "To consult the settings \nin-game, press the options \nbutton on your
    left \ncontroller, then press the \ngear icon on the left.\n\nThere you can adjust
    \nmovement, and volume \nsettings.\n\nOn your headset below your right eye, you
    can adjust the volume on hardware level, though I will ask that you keep some
