      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "To dig the ball with two \nhands, you must hit the ball\nwith both hands
    at the \nsame time.\n\nThe aim is determined by \nhow the ball would bounce \noff
    a platform created as \nan extension of your thumbs when digging.\n\nAs a pointer
    for direction, try to place your thumbs (in game) to how you would try to bounce
    off a ball where you want it to go.\nHand & ball speed combined on impact determine
    set strength."
