  m_text: "Matches start automatically \nwith the first serve.\n\nTo serve, just
    grab the ball,\nthen release your grip for \nthe ball to fly straight up.\nThe
    ball's trajectory might\ndeviate if your hand is not \nentirely still when releasing.\n\nWhile
    in freeplay, points will not be counted, and the ball will always spawn for you
    to serve.\nOnce you start the experiment, matches go until any team reaches 11
    points (no tie breaks). The team winning a point serves for the next. \n\nEvery
    5 points, you will be prompted to adjust the crowd levels. Feel free to play
    around with the setting until you are comfortable, there is no recommended setting
    :)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
